{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-p003a","title":"孙策给周瑜鼓吹治馆舍并下令称功","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-p003a-account","label":"《江表传》","text":"孙策给周瑜鼓吹治馆舍并下令称功","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p003a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"赏赐","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p003a-q"]},{"person":"zhou-yu","role":"受赏","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p003a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":198,"label":"孙策迎周瑜时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhouyu-y198","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhouyu-q-o004","basis":"孙策迎周瑜时"},"evidence":["zhouyu-e-p003a-q","zhouyu-q-o004","xianzhu-q-o013","wudi-q-o054","wudi-q-b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-p003a-q","source_order":[54,30,"P003a"],"order":9583}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0099","name":"孙策","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhou-yu","name":"周瑜","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：建安三年（公元 198）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":327,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1273453201e8129c485c","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o054","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ec1ae0750950ac5532fb","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，公还许。初置军师祭酒〖2〗。三月，公围张绣于穰。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o013","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-2bcaabf007ae7b6068f2","layer":"original","quote":"先主还小沛，﹝一﹞复合兵得万余人。吕布恶之，自出兵攻先主。先主败走归曹公〖1〗，曹公厚遇之〖2〗，以为豫州牧。将至沛收散卒，给其军粮；益与兵，使东击布。布遣高顺攻之〖3〗；曹公遣夏侯惇往，不能救；为顺所败，复虏先主妻子送布。曹公自出东征，﹝二﹞助先主围布于下邳。生擒布，先主复得妻子。从曹公还许，表先主为左将军；礼之愈重，出则同舆，坐则同席。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":171,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-p003a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-41f6539dc023f01318cf","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《江表传》曰：“策又给瑜鼓吹，为治馆舍，赠赐莫与为比。策令曰：‘周公瑾英俊异才，与孤有总角之好，骨肉之分。如前在丹杨，发众及船粮，以济大事；论德酬功，此未足以报者也。’”","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7f0cfa0da15ee7ab021d","start":0,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o004","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-49a6b8e43bb034d3e7b1","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，袁术遣从弟胤代尚为太守〖10〗，而瑜与尚俱还寿春。术欲以瑜为将；瑜观术终无所成，故求为居巢长，欲假途东归〖11〗。术听之，遂自居巢还吴。是岁，建安三年也。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
